<title>USA: MTS Systems gets Korean orders.</title>
<headline>MTS Systems gets Korean orders.</headline>
<dateline>EDEN PRAIRIE, Minn. 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>MTS Systems Corp said Thursday it received orders from two Korean car manufacturers for $8.8 million in vehicle test systems.</p>
<p>Neither manufacturer was identified.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
